   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Game Shows Touch Our Lives** (1 review): Interesting accompaniment is heard toward the end of this specific track [2]\n- **Get Lonely** (1 review): Listener claims to hear John nod out during the performance of this song [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Half Dead**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **If You See Light**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Alpha Double Negative: Going to Catalina**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2006-09-24** (recommended): source not stated; 15 songs; 61 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Audio is bass-heavy and muffled, possibly due to room acoustics, with a neat binaural effect [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2006-09-24**: taped by Peter Sohriakoff; source: Core Sound Binaurial Microphones (CSB's) > Sony Hi-MD MZ-RH10 (1.4mbps PCM ) [1]",
